x11-magnifier (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: static zoom via Ctrl+Shift+scroll, edge panning.
  * Live refresh of the zoomed view (Composite+Damage); -p static, -r rate.
  * Config file (-c).
  * Re-read the screen when windows close/move or the workspace changes
    (workspace_switch = refresh|exit).
  * Dual-licensed MIT or Apache-2.0.

